      "writtenOn": "2023-07-14T16:37:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This CL works but I wanted to get some feedback on whether we actually want it. Basically this was a response to some tests that include for loops that include calls to `TEST_EQ` (and similar), which presently print out `PASS` on each iteration. This CL will inhibit printing PASS on each iteration but will print on failure. \n\nAn alternative method would be to include a whole new suite of functions like `TEST_EQ_PRINTONFAIL` but I don\u0027t really love that solution.\n\nThoughts?",
      "revId": "a7b6ef7aa585ac26fabd2d15f4dc37d8c057d090",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
