      "writtenOn": "2023-07-17T16:01:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this can potentially solve some problems that we have seen in the algo tests. Can you please share an example of where `TEST_OPERATOR_INHIBIT_PRINT_EVAL` shall be defined? I will give +1 for now to see if others have any feedback on this CL.",
      "parentUuid": "7bd6f475_a6efac8c",
      "revId": "a7b6ef7aa585ac26fabd2d15f4dc37d8c057d090",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
