      "writtenOn": "2023-10-03T22:07:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Similar to `TEST_OPERATOR_INHIBIT_PRINT_EVAL` it could be put in either the test\u0027s tasklist file (i.e. `test/aes.tasklist`) or, probably better, at the top of the test source file (i.e. `test/aes.cc`).\n\nI think this was initially written for a helipilot test that was having trouble keeping up with the printing of some test, but it turned out to not be needed. I left it open to see if others found it useful.",
      "parentUuid": "ed72316f_64919302",
